        },
        {
          "text": " Alivyotoka tumboni mwa mamaye, atakwenda tena tuputupu kama alivyokuja; asichume kitu chochote kwa ajili ya kazi yake, hata akichukue mkononi mwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
